# a WebAssembly module with no system interface that its host calls only through its exports
# (WebAssembly core specification 1.0, binary format)
flags --target freestanding-wasm32 -k module
takes reactor
local wasm-tools validate
has   Format: WASM
has   Version: 0x1
has   Type: CODE
has   Type: MEMORY
has   Type: EXPORT
# the module exports its memory as `memory` and no entry, since its host starts nothing
has   Name: memory ; Kind: MEMORY
lacks Name: _start
lacks Name: _initialize
# no system supplies a module, so a program that declares no import imports nothing
lacks Type: IMPORT
lacks Module: wasi_snapshot_preview1
# an active data segment initializes memory 0, the only memory a 1.0 module may have
each  MemoryIndex ; MemoryIndex: 0
